        },
        {
          "text": "askwearjoojisu gajeepkeadi nea geang'waay aba jeacheenga sean ea gilinyoo ea fugeaba geahi ea darooraka, ea mujiini, nea askwearjoojisu bea Burimu adeapuut aba jeeda fuga Israeli nea giipkeataanyi ea adagoosha aba jeacheenga nyaawa.",
          "type": "text",
