        {
          "text": "Hean gatmooda sugoocheanda, was Esta was hudeaba Abihaili niny sea Mordekai was siida Israeli geang'waar aba gheambalmeesean masooda barawajeanji bea iyeenya bea Burimu. ",
          "type": "text",
