          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea askwearjoojigiga bea Burimu gajeang'waay aba damandaanyi, gawuurji gidaghayi nyaashta Mordekai was siida Israeli ea gatmooda sugoocheanda was Esta ghayi rukusiinda fuga Israeli ea gidarukusiinda geat ea jeacheenga nyaawa, ak geeluulda geat nea geenyahuushi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
